<title>USA: LCI in calling card pact with Kmart.</title>
<headline>LCI in calling card pact with Kmart.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>LCI International Inc said it will be the exclusive provider of prepaid calling cards to Kmart Corp.</p>
<p>The card will come in 40 and 80 minute calling denominations. Users can place calls from anywhere in the United States to 230 countries worldwide.</p>
<p>The card will charge customers in six-second increments, and will not round calls to the next full-minute.</p>
</text>
